      "text": "```\nFile 01 — Ancient Greek     The foundation. Every subsequent debate traces back here.\nFile 02 — Hellenistic/Roman Ethics and cosmopolitanism as practical philosophy.\nFile 03 — Medieval/Islamic  How Greek philosophy survived, transformed, and returned.\nFile 04 — Rationalists      The \"deduce everything from clear ideas\" project.\nFile 05 — Empiricists       The \"experience is all we have\" counter-project.\nFile 06 — Kant/Idealism     The synthesis that defines modern philosophy's structure.\nFile 07 — 19th Century      Reaction against Hegel — existentialism, materialism.\nFile 08 — Analytic          Logic-driven philosophy (closest to TCS background).\nFile 09 — Continental       Phenomenology, existentialism, political philosophy.\n```"
    },
